[{"title":"五言二首 其二","author":"王淹","text":"钟鼎山林事，都卢一梦中。\n观音门里去，叶叶响悲风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18727,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五言二首 其一","author":"王淹","text":"一雨日夜零，阶前草更青。\n西风忽萧飒，残月照空庭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18728,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵文夫兄病目新起","author":"王淹","text":"胸中眸子坦何疑，不见妖蟆叹月诗。\n牛背神光元我在，虎头墨妙敢吾欺。\n竞看投杖行成矩，会起弯弨满中规。\n可惜平生忧国泪，眼明犹及见清时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18729,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄蒋季庄","author":"王淹","text":"桃花水起问行舟，时不能留迹自留。\n何有声名呼子慎，傥能饥渴念之罘。\n前车或向中涂废，古井难持短绠求。\n闻说下帷书已就，愿从繁露识春秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18730,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吾兄文夫宦游天台余将官于江左不胜感离之情用韦苏州那知风雨夜复此对床眠为韵作十诗以寄 其五","author":"王淹","text":"雨叶收馀音，寒虫怨遥夜。\n向来十年灯，致论秦屡借。\n白头错料事，抱璞睎世价。\n出门已绝倒，一字不堪藉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18731,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吾兄文夫宦游天台余将官于江左不胜感离之情用韦苏州那知风雨夜复此对床眠为韵作十诗以寄 其十","author":"王淹","text":"小草有远志，大樗可长年。\n山林自相许，风雨堪独眠。\n稍须三径资，莫问五湖船。\n从今坐右铭，可刻招隐篇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18732,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吾兄文夫宦游天台余将官于江左不胜感离之情用韦苏州那知风雨夜复此对床眠为韵作十诗以寄 其九","author":"王淹","text":"田园久芜没，何适为故乡。\n眷兹南阳阡，松柏日苍苍。\n但恨云边茅，无地安藜床。\n采蕨饮江水，此人那得忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18733,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吾兄文夫宦游天台余将官于江左不胜感离之情用韦苏州那知风雨夜复此对床眠为韵作十诗以寄 其七","author":"王淹","text":"安道乐东山，少游志乡里。\n二龙各同渊，屈信有彼此。\n何年金华客，异世赤松子。\n此谋非人决，头颅当自揣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18734,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吾兄文夫宦游天台余将官于江左不胜感离之情用韦苏州那知风雨夜复此对床眠为韵作十诗以寄 其六","author":"王淹","text":"母慈怀远音，积雨人未复。\n朝来鸟鹊喜，门外书一幅。\n小邦王事繁，夜食忘归沐。\n何处望飞凫，山中酒初熟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18735,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吾兄文夫宦游天台余将官于江左不胜感离之情用韦苏州那知风雨夜复此对床眠为韵作十诗以寄 其一","author":"王淹","text":"秋风一夕来，木落江水波。\n相将雁南翔，奈有孤飞何。\n四海兄弟少，百年离别多。\n傥坚归来心，富贵尔则那。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18736,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吾兄文夫宦游天台余将官于江左不胜感离之情用韦苏州那知风雨夜复此对床眠为韵作十诗以寄 其二","author":"王淹","text":"送君南浦上，风烟惨前知。\n当时长江水，已与沧溟期。\n海经远山外，人在高楼时。\n潮来君莫忘，中有清泪滋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18737,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吾兄文夫宦游天台余将官于江左不胜感离之情用韦苏州那知风雨夜复此对床眠为韵作十诗以寄 其四","author":"王淹","text":"先人昔营菟，嵩少买别墅。\n后生久逸乐，稍识田家苦。\n平生十具牛，独立方寸土。\n至今龙门滩，犹梦秋夜雨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18738,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吾兄文夫宦游天台余将官于江左不胜感离之情用韦苏州那知风雨夜复此对床眠为韵作十诗以寄 其八","author":"王淹","text":"膏以明自销，翟以文故翳。\n两苏事业远，卒与忧患对。\n夕阳西州道，江海怆馀悔。\n九折更徐驱，前有覆轨在。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18739,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吾兄文夫宦游天台余将官于江左不胜感离之情用韦苏州那知风雨夜复此对床眠为韵作十诗以寄 其三","author":"王淹","text":"我家尺五天，行人指城东。\n老槐阅世故，高荫自清风。\n叵量陵谷变，犹叹斤斧空。\n故国岂乔木，遂应人与同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18740,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋浦见陆次川会其有广德之役同游齐山而别既归以诗寄之","author":"王淹","text":"我车疾驱无停辀，君马既秣犹少留。\n客怀那更见行色，胜地不能成纵游。\n君去我愁归路远，黄叶霜风山意晚。\n几时云外有音来，早送文书遮病眼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18741,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄仲子","author":"王淹","text":"汝生十七年，不离父母膝。\n抗言求自试，立意坚且必。\n父母不汝拒，汝志诚少匹。\n束书下扁舟，挂席飞鸟疾。\n书来报善达，授馆亦云佚。\n进修不多言，祝汝慎非一。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18742,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太常引 题洞宾醉桃源像","author":"王清观","text":"邯郸梦里武陵溪。\n春色醉冥迷。\n花压帽檐欹，谩赢得、红尘满衣。\n青蛇飞起，黄龙喝住，才是酒醒时。\n和露饮刀圭。\n待月满、长空鹤归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18743,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋夜寄水月水云二昆玉","author":"王清惠","text":"万里倦行役，秋来瘦几分。\n因看河北月，忽忆海东云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18744,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"捣衣诗呈水云","author":"王清惠","text":"妾命薄如叶，流离万里行。\n黄尘燕塞外，愁坐听衣声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18745,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李陵台和水云韵","author":"王清惠","text":"李陵台上望，答子五言诗。\n客路八千里，乡心十二时。\n孟劳欣已税，区脱未相离。\n忽报江南使，新来贡荔枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18746,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"王清惠","text":"愁到侬时酒自斟，挑灯看剑泪痕深。\n黄金台迥少知己，碧玉调高空好音。\n万叶秋声孤馆梦，一窗寒月故乡心。\n庭前昨夜梧桐雨，劲气潇潇入短襟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18747,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送水云归吴","author":"王清惠","text":"朔风猎猎割人面，万里归人泪如霰。\n江南江北路茫茫，粟酒千钟为君劝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18748,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红","author":"王清惠","text":"太液芙蓉，浑不似、旧时颜色。\n曾记得、春风雨露，玉楼金阙。\n名播兰簪妃后里，晕潮莲脸君王侧。\n忽一声、鼙鼓揭天来，繁华歇。\n龙虎散，风云灭。\n千古恨，凭谁说。\n对山河百二，泪盈襟血。\n客馆夜惊尘土梦，宫车晓碾关山月。\n问嫦娥、于我肯从容，同圆缺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18749,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"广胜寺","author":"王渊亭","text":"春岭碧嵯峨，公馀载酒过。\n红尘随地少，野意近山多。\n泉溜寒鸣玉，杨花碎剪罗。\n归衫未能著，斜日上松坡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18750,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"王渎","text":"东湖富泉石。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18751,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月夜登楼","author":"王渔壑","text":"维舟古柳傍严城，借我今宵倚晚晴。\n一笛清风秋万里，半楼残月夜三更。\n客怀耿耿清樽窄，世故悠悠白发生。\n醉倒拍床谁唤醒，辘轳声里辨长庚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18752,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢王绣使同二教举充讲宾","author":"王翊龙","text":"绣衣玉斧下青冥，端为斯文主夏盟。\n师道更全双璧白，讲堂初奏六茎清。\n秦灰不烬诗书种，孔壁犹铿丝竹声。\n惟有渔翁祇自叹，谈经敢望汉鸿生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18753,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"煎茶","author":"王翊龙","text":"春霆发蕾抽新馥，榷吏穷搜不容粟。\n是谁千金收寸芽，烹鼎车声绕斜谷。\n白云飘落甘露椀，清风吹破玉川屋。\n平生此腹负将军，空揽十年灯火读。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18754,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"禁林宴会之什","author":"王著","text":"文明天子重词臣，圣制褒扬日月新。\n宸翰特颁仙署额，皇风先发玉堂春。\n虬龙逸势诚难伏，鸾鹤回翔信得真。\n齐武任誇非入妙，汉章虽巧未通神。\n匪唯衒耀鳌宫客，兼是辉华凤阁人。\n幸接英儒同赞咏，辄书狂斐继清尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18755,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吟赠梦英大师","author":"王著","text":"到处闻人乞篆踪，学来年久有深功。\n墨池阔类湘江水，笔冢高齐太华峰。\n金锡罢飞新解虎，铁盂收掌旧降龙。\n知师吟恋烟村景，不肯回头望九重。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18756,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十月晦日睡起","author":"王谌","text":"睡起西窗午正蹉，小春天气尚融和。\n颠狂绝笑檐前蝶，不道残阳已不多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18757,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山庵即景","author":"王谌","text":"一炷清香一局棋，坐看山雨到来时。\n晚晴独步出门去，云挂碧青松树枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18758,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题 其一","author":"王谌","text":"草绿花红展绣衾，菜畦一色漾黄金。\n行行山路情何限，春事三分一半深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18759,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次亚愚韵 其二","author":"王谌","text":"丝丝杨柳拂轻烟，那惜床头买酒钱。\n此段风流如不赏，一般佳致又明年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18760,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次亚愚韵 其四","author":"王谌","text":"寒梅一树照清池，花底嫣香尚觅诗。\n稚子不知吟思苦，却来池上数鱼儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18761,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次亚愚韵 其三","author":"王谌","text":"梅脸斓斑褪粉妆，桃心依约晕轻黄。\n春风花草经行遍，次第安排到海棠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18762,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句 其一","author":"王谌","text":"紫燕黄鹂兴已阑，薰风庭院绿阴寒。\n儿童竞说新篁长，只隔前窗懒去看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18763,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句 其三","author":"王谌","text":"过了荼蘼与素馨，一春风雨欠追寻。\n却从立夏晴多日，策杖闲来看绿阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18764,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句 其二","author":"王谌","text":"午风吹梦过桥西，梦里诗成未有题。\n睡起不知天早晚，柳风忽送子规啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18765,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送墨与则上人","author":"王谌","text":"遣送书斋小净瓶，麝煤藏久带芳馨。\n难书八万四千偈，只写多心一卷经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18766,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入山","author":"王谌","text":"入却山来事事宜，眼边何处不关诗。\n风飘花片上书册，水浸山峰入砚池。\n酒欲饮时斟易尽，棋当胜处著嫌迟。\n个中自有无穷趣，莫遣儿曹取次知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18767,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入邑 其二","author":"王谌","text":"野蔓侵沙径，山泉渡石梁。\n树头蚕葚熟，篱下雀梅香。\n人与春光老，閒随日影长。\n撚须吟不就，穷杀孟襄阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18768,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入邑 其一","author":"王谌","text":"马踏新松影，衣沾秀麦寒。\n藤花缀缨珞，竹笋透琅玕。\n诗向闲中得，心因静处宽。\n一声幽鸟啭，深在翠林端。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18769,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为简上人赋古色轩 其一","author":"王谌","text":"简师得道不参禅，燕坐常居古色轩。\n夏禹告功遗迹在，任公垂钓有车存。\n海通泉洞深千尺，寺映重岩月一痕。\n何日短筇尘外去，瓣香来此叩玄门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18770,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为简上人赋古色轩 其二","author":"王谌","text":"小舟咿哑渡横塘，十里秋畦粳稻香。\n莫怪雨声惊客梦，要催诗句入行囊。\n重过蘋水波浮绿，遥见菊篱花正黄。\n佳节莫论重九后，舣篷独酌汎茱觞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18771,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"友人招饮","author":"王谌","text":"故人邀我共清樽，蹑屐归来已半醺。\n无限雨声供醉笔，一窗灯影共谁分。\n铜瓶火煖鸣天籁，宝鼎香残拂岫云。\n今夜梦魂清更甚，扁舟冷伴白鸥群。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18772,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乍归","author":"王谌","text":"去日犹残雪，归来夏气清。\n闲随白云出，看到绿阴成。\n野色供诗料，山光快客情。\n路逢乡父老，驻足问行程。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18773,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"北林","author":"王谌","text":"经行到北林，此地转惊心。\n小市鱼虾贵，荒村竹树深。\n帆樯侵柳影，罾屋占溪阴。\n诗罢还飞去，沙鸥识苦吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18774,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归山","author":"王谌","text":"特地扪萝入翠微，杨花故故点征衣。\n游人尽逐暮光去，野老独携山色归。\n拟泛银涛浮浩渺，难寻玉貌问芳菲。\n吴亡越伯浑休问，且买清樽送落晖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18775,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"生日","author":"王谌","text":"又是逢初度，红稀绿暗时。\n自斟生日酒，闲理去年诗。\n活计惟书在，衰容只镜知。\n人情与天道，翻覆似枯棋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18776,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早行","author":"王谌","text":"晓入荆溪路，西风快似刀。\n雪深埋树脚，水浅见溪毛。\n岁序相将换，人心只自劳。\n牧童牛背卧，令我愧儿曹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18777,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次岳尚书韵","author":"王谌","text":"细字书横双眼明，破窗阅尽几阴晴。\n年来干禄浑无梦，老去吟诗尚有情。\n谩向纸田耕石砚，断无金缕侑银觥。\n和篇聊博先生笑，应笑寒儒太瘦生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18778,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟行","author":"王谌","text":"前面人家是画图，数间茅屋映菰蒲。\n濛笼云里群峰出，欸乃滩边一棹孤。\n岁熟农人还自乐，天晴水鸟竞相呼。\n绝怜两岸垂丝柳，比却来时一半枯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18779,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过山家","author":"王谌","text":"此地知谁隐，当门列翠屏。\n栽花多是药，题壁半书经。\n栗鼠咀红果，山禽堕翠翎。\n峰头宜眺望，只欠小茅亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18780,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴江桥","author":"王谌","text":"松江期一到，二十二三年。\n今日身临此，凭虚骨欲仙。\n塔连吴苑树，帆带洞庭烟。\n见说鲈鱼美，囊无斫鲙钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18781,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"远出乍归","author":"王谌","text":"五旬行李经吴越，四月风光正惠夷。\n绿水悠悠晴脉脉，青条总总实离离。\n飞来何处双黄蝶，叫彻他山一子规。\n却把闲身成倦客，关心书几昼长时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18782,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饭罢 其二","author":"王谌","text":"雪意犹商略，溪云半有无。\n短莎眠野犊，枯树点寒乌。\n牢落诗仍在，萧条岁已徂。\n过门人挽住，相倩写桃符。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18783,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饭罢 其一","author":"王谌","text":"饭罢扣松关，襟怀分外宽。\n冻云深拥寺，寒濑浅鸣滩。\n苔剥碑文字，香萦古篆盘。\n寻春难著句，为怕起愁端。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18784,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"到此","author":"王谌","text":"到此添离恨，垂杨已拂肩。\n担轻缘少镪，衣暖欲抽绵。\n春事遽如许，客怀殊未然。\n竹篱沽酒市，雨湿杏花烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18785,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"到李山寺","author":"王谌","text":"策杖扣禅坊，空山草木长。\n殿荒人晒席，僧去佛无香。\n榆树苔衣绿，松花粉穗黄。\n兹行无伴侣，独自绕修廊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18786,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"招玉渊","author":"王谌","text":"欲言非一事，晓夕待君来。\n吟屋新装办，闲门未敢开。\n春光归巷陌，山色入楼台。\n犹有梅花在，相期把酒杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18787,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"虎丘","author":"王谌","text":"五百年前吾祖宅，云孙从昔未曾经。\n山藏古寺窗连碧，水绕平田稻正青。\n台染夜云微带润，剑涵秋水尚馀腥。\n僧堂借得羊毛笔，自蘸寒泉写石屏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18788,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姚村夜泊","author":"王谌","text":"荒村日已黄，小泊近横塘。\n昨夜一番雨，今宵满意凉。\n湿沙藏蚓唱，风柳卸萤光。\n隔浦谁家住，吹来荷叶香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18789,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柳絮","author":"王谌","text":"解作漫天雪，终成满地灰。\n行空无挂碍，入幕任徘徊。\n巧趁蜂须去，轻随燕翼来。\n颠狂浑不定，飞舞过楼台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18790,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋风","author":"王谌","text":"去年相遇钓鱼矶，今岁飘飘又入扉。\n渡月薄侵蟾兔冷，拂云轻助燕鸿飞。\n逗遛馀响惊残梦，催促新寒上裌衣。\n欲把丝桐传此曲，破琴弦断损金徽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18791,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送薛端夫赴武学赴举","author":"王谌","text":"温然如美玉，文以武兼之。\n发镞妙穿的，挥毫不待思。\n行途多早气，参学已秋期。\n捷报重阳近，黄花汎一卮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18792,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"借楼","author":"王谌","text":"借得小楼聊寄迹，夜深犹自未扃扉。\n鼠摇暗壁惊人梦，萤度破窗粘客衣。\n旧隐图书从水汎，后园松菊与心违。\n思量应被沙鸥笑，烟雨满船胡不归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18793,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"旅中述怀","author":"王谌","text":"未晚僮先卧，无聊自展衾。\n一灯愁里梦，数首客中吟。\n邻舍谁歌曲，谯更远送音。\n秋风催素发，憔悴满华簪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18794,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]